      <p>CallTeam provides done-for-you B2B outbound calling and appointment setting. In simple terms, we take responsibility for the work between a list of possible buyers and a qualified sales conversation.</p>
      <p>If you have no list, we can help build one. If you already have leads, we can call them. If old CRM contacts have gone quiet, we can follow up. If inbound, event, webinar, referral, or target-account leads need a human conversation, we can work through them. We agree on who to contact, what to say, what counts as qualified, and how a good opportunity reaches your team.</p>
      <div class="home-truth-line">You do not need another database full of names. You need the right people contacted, followed up, qualified, and moved toward a real next step.</div>
